    Handling varied by plugin structure:
    - Most plugins share the reference pattern (single other_2/other_1
      exchange field, QRZ+LOGIT appended together) and got the standard
      3-edit patch (CQ-branch reset, correction check before QRZ, and
      tracking/reset in the send loop).
