    When several macros were sent using CAT keying, the space between them
    was missing. The Run F2 F3 sequence was sent as "DL0ABC5NN 001".
    
    The problem is that rigctl is not recognizing "b " as a command to send
    a space, it has to be "b  ". So add a space after "b" in the
    rigctrlsocket command, just like the other commands do.
    
